 "about_text": "Pauhaus Gallery + Events is an artist-founded creative hub on Melrose Avenue in Los Angeles, established in 2021 by artist Pau (Pau Aguirre) after she found a vacant storefront space. What began as the twice-weekly Melrose Drawing Club figure-drawing sessions grew into a multidisciplinary venue hosting exhibitions, comedy shows, open mics, and other community-driven events. The gallery serves as a gathering place for artists, musicians, comedians, and creatives of all kinds, reflecting founder Pau's own background as a muralist and figure-drawing enthusiast. Pauhaus has also been the subject of press coverage for exhibitions of animation and stop-motion artists, and its founder is now exploring expansion of the concept to other cities.",
